{"kind":"grammar","lang":"en","entities":{"n1-025":{"renderings":[{"id":"d4f564d5c2f0044d","role":"prose","field":"shortExplanation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-025"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"An emphatic pattern meaning 'it may be X, but definitely not Y.' Often pairs with a negative statement."},{"id":"1dcdc9440666f22f","role":"prose","field":"longExplanation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-025"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"「Noun/Verb-ます形 + こそすれ」emphasizes that while one aspect (X) might exist or be true, another aspect (Y) absolutely does not. It's frequently used with negative expressions (e.g., 〜ない、〜できない) to strongly deny the second possibility."},{"id":"e6747cd21582d591","role":"prose","field":"formation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-025"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"Noun + こそすれ + (negative or contrasting statement)"},{"id":"b33b753e221e7dda","role":"prose","field":"usageNote","source":{"source":"gokan","ref":"n1-025"},"match":"id","status":"reviewed","value":"Noun こそすれ～ない: certainly X, never Y (感謝こそすれ)."},{"id":"d9af84a42d98e34b","role":"label","field":"family","source":{"source":"gokan","ref":"koso"},"match":"id","status":"reviewed","value":"Emphasis With こそ (Precisely / Only By)","of":{"kind":"family","id":"koso"}}]},"n1-025#ba2c12256cde":{"renderings":[{"id":"c77551847fda3fa2","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-025"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"I might feel grateful, but I could never criticize."}]},"n1-025#d9ff7fb445ff":{"renderings":[{"id":"6c528f45e119dfe7","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-025"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"I may be busy, but I'm never bored."}]},"n1-025#a1b25786342d":{"renderings":[{"id":"d741050012f56336","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-025"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"I might regret it, but I can't forget it."}]},"n1-025#3c16eeb927be":{"renderings":[{"id":"dfdaafacbf176d31","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-025"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"I may have doubts, but I cannot agree."}]}}}